  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"0123789"` |
  | *found* `s[0:7]` | `"0123789"` |

  >>> test_re (Re.rep1 (Re.diff (Re.rg '0' '9') (Re.rg '4' '6'))) "4"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"4"` |
  | *search in* `s` | *not found* |

### `compl`

  >>> test_re (Re.rep1 (Re.compl [ Re.rg '0' '9'; Re.rg 'a' 'z' ])) "A:Z+"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"A:Z+"` |
