  | *search in* `s` | *not found* |

  >>> test_re (Re.rep1 (Re.compl [ Re.rg '0' '9'; Re.rg 'a' 'z' ])) "a"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"a"` |
  | *search in* `s` | *not found* |

### Case sensitivity

  >>> test_re (Re.case (Re.str "abc")) "abc"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"abc"` |
  | *found* `s[0:3]` | `"abc"` |

  >>> test_re (Re.no_case (Re.case (Re.str "abc"))) "abc"
