  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"ABC"` |
  | *search in* `s` | *not found* |

  >>> test_re (Re.no_case (Re.case (Re.str "abc"))) "ABC"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"ABC"` |
  | *search in* `s` | *not found* |

  >>> test_re (Re.no_case (Re.str "abc")) "abc"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"abc"` |
  | *found* `s[0:3]` | `"abc"` |

  >>> test_re (Re.no_case (Re.str "abc")) "ABC"
  \markdown\;| | |
  | --- | --- |
  | *string under test* `s` | `"ABC"` |
  | *found* `s[0:3]` | `"ABC"` |

